# An agent's execution history, from the chat's own sheet ("…": its agents) and the agent's card (历史): what it
# received and posted, its steps; a group opened, a command in it opened to what it printed.
timeout 60000
tap 端到端测试
until =studio
until 发消息
wait 1000
tap 发消息
type 看看文档 {T} steps:文档目录看过了 {T}
tap icon:arrow-up
gone 正在发送
timeout 120000
untiln 2 文档目录看过了 {T}
wait 1500
tap icon:more
until 复制会话链接
shot 1-info
tap icon:chevron-right
until =历史
shot 2-agent
tap =历史
until 执行历史
until 文档目录看过了 {T}
shot 3-history
tap icon:chevron-right
until 列出 docs 目录
tap 列出 docs 目录
until stillfail-port.md
shot 4-step
